                        "sense_id": "ab7c42f5-23c4-39c6-9c84-a75f370e6548",
                        "entry_id": "d7e372a9-541f-3e73-8858-108a420e8e89",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of the nature of a hedgehog: externally repellent; difficult to get on with."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f57bf19d-e21c-4579-8cf8-4824b5ef6a71",
                                "sense_id": "ab7c42f5-23c4-39c6-9c84-a75f370e6548",
                                "text": "‘Why is it that we English, when we meet abroad, are so very friendly, and when we reappear in London are so very hedgyhoggy?’ I told her that the reason why there was no hedgehogginess on this occasion was because I was not an Englishman."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0bf8d66-95d8-40a5-8652-a30e8ce7b340",
                                "sense_id": "ab7c42f5-23c4-39c6-9c84-a75f370e6548",
                                "text": "So your hedgehoggy readers roll themselves over and over their Bibles, and declare that whatever sticks to their own spines is Scripture."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "89447f9c-efc1-4ab0-971d-33faa63c272d",
                                "sense_id": "ab7c42f5-23c4-39c6-9c84-a75f370e6548",
                                "text": "Get near some of those dear hedgehoggy brethren, and go and make a pillow of them."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ddd225ac-6029-346b-8a70-13702eedc23f",
                        "entry_id": "d7e372a9-541f-3e73-8858-108a420e8e89",
                        "glosses": [
                            "With a worldview based on a single overarching idea."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "37be2f34-db05-409f-bb4f-3242dcda4450",
                                "sense_id": "ddd225ac-6029-346b-8a70-13702eedc23f",
                                "text": "For half a century, psychotherapy was dominated by hedgehoggy men who considered their style \"normal,\" and women's foxy, emotional, flexible style \"hysterical.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b02813b3-4cc9-4b7d-8dbe-eae62be18360",
                                "sense_id": "ddd225ac-6029-346b-8a70-13702eedc23f",
                                "text": "The wary reader will at this point justifiably ask whether an endorsement of Hardin's model may commit us to the hedgehoggy, unidimensional thinking of apocalyptic ecologists and their IPAT equation, a position we found too rigid"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
